; Phase 42F - the Ash Hunters' finale. Knowledge, not a kill count: three Reach objectives on the
; three already-mapped roosts (Wild, Ash, Ancient). Whether any dragon is alive or dead does not
; matter - the verdict (slay / judge / withdraw) is given at Yrsa's hand-in and recorded as
; flag.ash_hunters.<verdict>; rank three and guild.ash_hunters.finale follow in the same chain.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Obj_wild"]
